      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW SAUNDRA (8) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 22.41. Draws out wide but has the ability and in winning form. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. Hard to fault her form and she makes plenty of appeal. DOONGALLA ADAM (6) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 2 lengths at Geelong in a handy 22.61 beating Big Mako. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Deserves serious consideration again. DOONGALLA BOY (7) jumped cleanly from the rails last start to lead all the way and score (22.42) at this track in a Grade 5 over 390m. Shapes as a top winning chance on latest effort. TAKE A SELFIE (4) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
